# Mechanic: Opponent-turn priority for cycling requires payable mana.
# Forcing: Shark Typhoon is the only potential response. No combat or AI spells.
# AI behavior: Empty hand and battlefield leave only phase progression.
# Failure modes: An unpayable response must not stop the opponent turn;
# a payable response must remain available before the human turn.
# Card roles: Shark Typhoon provides cycling; Islands control affordability.
# Protocol path: ActionsAvailableReq active versus inactive activations.
